    "code": "from legacy_cipher import encrypt_for_partner\n\n\ndef build_partner_payload(key: bytes, settlement: bytes) -> bytes:\n    \"\"\"\n    Encrypt the settlement file for the partner system using three-key Triple-DES in CBC mode\n    with PKCS7 padding and 8-byte IV prepended to the ciphertext.\n\n    Args:\n        key (bytes): 24-byte three-key TDEA key.\n        settlement (bytes): The plaintext settlement file data.\n\n    Returns:\n        bytes: IV || ciphertext encrypted for the partner.\n\n    Raises:\n        PermissionError: If encryption is disallowed by current NIST guidance.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Encryption with three-key TDEA is disallowed after 2023 except for legacy use.\n    # The legacy_cipher.encrypt_for_partner function raises PermissionError to prevent new encryption.\n    return encrypt_for_partner(key, settlement)\n",
